 "DNG is better for archiving and portability: the specification is open, so software will likely be able to read it decades from now. Proprietary formats sometimes carry slightly more camera-specific data. Many photographers shoot proprietary RAW and archive to DNG — ShiftRaw converts either kind.": "dng-to-jpg,dng-to-png,dng-to-webp",
